5158"] ["question-7b8162a3-2a18-5498-a3a6-ab4fdf90d980" :question/problem "Find $x$, if $5a-2x=b$ and\n\n$$\na=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}],\\,b=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -6 \\\\ -6\\end{aligned}].\n$$"] ["question-7b8162a3-2a18-5498-a3a6-ab4fdf90d980" :question/worked-solution "Using the properties of addition/subtraction and scalar multiplication of vectors to isolate $x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5a-2x & =b \\\\ -2x & =b-5a \\\\ x & =-\\frac{1}{2}(b-5a) \\\\ x & =-\\frac{1}{2}([\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -6 \\\\ -6\\end{aligned}]-5[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]) \\\\ x & =-\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}-8 \\\\ -6 \\\\ -6 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\ x & =[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-7b8162a3-2a18-5498-a3a6-ab4fdf90d980" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-167770ed-e7de-54b6-9bfa-73c5e3df3786" :answer-field/id #uuid "167770ed-e7de-54b6-9bfa-73c5e3df3786"] ["answer-e9436cfd-df38-58b3-bdb8-5acac9079d34" :answer/id #uuid "e9436cfd-df38-58b3-bdb8-5acac9079d34"] ["answer-e9436cfd-df38-58b3-bdb8-5acac9079d34" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-e9436cfd-df38-58b3-bdb8-5acac9079d34" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-02aca304-7b48-53d3-b89a-9ec1254a925a" :answer/id #uuid "02aca304-7b48-53d3-b89a-9ec1254a925a"] ["answer-02aca304-7b48-53d3-b89a-9ec1254a925a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-02aca304-7b48-53d3-b89a-9ec1254a925a" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ -3 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-bb24ab63-f2c2-5312-9f4a-1f89c660eb2b" :answer/id #uuid "bb24ab63-f2c2-5312-9f4a-1f89c660eb2b"] ["answer-bb24ab63-f2c2-5312-9f4a-1f89c660eb2b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-bb24ab63-f2c2-5312-9f4a-1f89c660eb2b" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-c9cf2b8d-50b4-5dea-8cdb-f6d96e285ac9" :answer/id #uuid "c9cf2b8d-50b4-5dea-8cdb-f6d96e285ac9"] ["answer-c9cf2b8d-50b4-5dea-8cdb-f6d96e285ac9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-c9cf2b8d-50b4-5dea-8cdb-f6d96e285ac9" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-77982fef-cbd9-5b64-9beb-aef93c81e8b7" :answer/id #uuid "77982fef-cbd9-5b64-9beb-aef93c81e8b7"] ["answer-77982fef-cbd9-5b64-9beb-aef93c81e8b7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-77982fef-cbd9-5b64-9beb-aef93c81e8b7" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-field-167770ed-e7de-54b6-9bfa-73c5e3df3786" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-167770ed-e7de-54b6-9bfa-73c5e3df3786" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-167770ed-e7de-54b6-9bfa-73c5e3df3786" :answer-field/correct "answer-77982fef-cbd9-5b64-9beb-aef93c81e8b7"] ["answer-field-167770ed-e7de-54b6-9bfa-73c5e3df3786" :answer-field/choices "answer-e9436cfd-df38-58b3-bdb8-5acac9079d34"] ["answer-field-167770ed-e7de-54b6-9bfa-73c5e3df3786" :answer-field/choices "answer-02aca304-7b48-53d3-b89a-9ec1254a925a"] ["answer-field-167770ed-e7de-54b6-9bfa-73c5e3df3786" :answer-field/choices "answer-bb24ab63-f2c2-5312-9f4a-1f89c660eb2b"] ["answer-field-167770ed-e7de-54b6-9bfa-73c5e3df3786" :answer-field/choices "answer-c9cf2b8d-50b4-5dea-8cdb-f6d96e285ac9"] ["answer-field-167770ed-e7de-54b6-9bfa-73c5e3df3786" :answer-field/choices "answer-77982fef-cbd9-5b64-9beb-aef93c81e8b7"] ["question-7b8162a3-2a18-5498-a3a6-ab4fdf90d980" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-167770ed-e7de-54b6-9bfa-73c5e3df3786"] [17592186119806 :knowledge-point/questions "question-7b8162a3-2a18-5498-a3a6-ab4fdf90d980"] ["question-f9fda870-d2c0-5b67-a720-dd733f4059b5" :question/id #uuid "f9fda870-d2c0-5b67-a720-dd733f4059b5"] ["question-f9fda870-d2c0-5b67-a720-dd733f4059b5" :question/math-academy-id "q-105163"] ["question-f9fda870-d2c0-5b67-a720-dd733f4059b5" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 7 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}],\\,{a}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}],\\,b=[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -11\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$"] ["question-f9fda870-d2c0-5b67-a720-dd733f4059b5" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b,$ then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 7 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -11\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}5{x}_{1} \\\\ 7{x}_{1} \\\\ -{x}_{1}\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{2} \\\\ 4{x}_{2} \\\\ 3{x}_{2}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -11\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}5{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} \\\\ 7{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -11\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}5{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}=4 \\\\ 7{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2}=-1 \\\\ -{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2}=-11\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the first equation by $(-2)$ and adding the result to the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-3{x}_{1} & =-9\\,⟹\\,{x}_{1}=3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${x}_{1}=3$ into the first equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5(3)+2{x}_{2} & =4\\,⟹\\,{x}_{2}=-\\frac{11}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting ${x}_{1}=3$ and ${x}_{2}=-\\frac{11}{2}$ into the third equation, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2} & =-11 \\\\ -(3)+3(-\\frac{11}{2}) & =-11 \\\\ -\\frac{33}{2} & =-8,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a false statement. \n\nSo, the system has no solution."] ["question-f9fda870-d2c0-5b67-a720-dd733f4059b5" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-036cd528-ad80-51a8-8b57-1c098a2a1799" :answer-field/id #uuid "036cd528-ad80-51a8-8b57-1c098a2a1799"] ["answer-9dfb10a9-8436-5e35-b531-240827bbf3d9" :answer/id #uuid "9dfb10a9-8436-5e35-b531-240827bbf3d9"] ["answer-9dfb10a9-8436-5e35-b531-240827bbf3d9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-9dfb10a9-8436-5e35-b531-240827bbf3d9" :answer/value "-1"] ["answer-d28d263f-fd3b-5140-9893-862b22fa936d" :answer/id #uuid "d28d263f-fd3b-5140-9893-862b22fa936d"] ["answer-d28d263f-fd3b-5140-9893-862b22fa936d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-d28d263f-fd3b-5140-9893-862b22fa936d" :answer/value "-3"] ["answer-bd9c2754-dc15-56f5-8e26-d514db78cd49" :answer/id #uuid "bd9c2754-dc15-56f5-8e26-d514db78cd49"] ["answer-bd9c2754-dc15-56f5-8e26-d514db78cd49" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-bd9c2754-dc15-56f5-8e26-d514db78cd49" :answer/value "5"] ["answer-eb547a3b-90e6-5909-88af-1af5468ae682" :answer/id #uuid "eb547a3b-90e6-5909-88af-1af5468ae682"] ["answer-eb547a3b-90e6-5909-88af-1af5468ae682" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-eb547a3b-90e6-5909-88af-1af5468ae682" :answer/value "6"] ["answer-a534e8f3-d655-5502-bc89-53c81026a425" :answer/id #uuid "a534e8f3-d655-5502-bc89-53c81026a425"] ["answer-a534e8f3-d655-5502-bc89-53c81026a425" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-a534e8f3-d655-5502-bc89-53c81026a425" :answer/value "No solution"] ["answer-field-036cd528-ad80-51a8-8b57-1c098a2a1799" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-036cd528-ad80-51a8-8b57-1c098a2a1799" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-036cd528-ad80-51a8-8b57-1c098a2a1799" :answer-field/correct "answer-a534e8f3-d655-5502-bc89-53c81026a425"] ["answer-field-036cd528-ad80-51a8-8b57-1c098a2a1799" :answer-field/choices "answer-9dfb10a9-8436-5e35-b531-240827bbf3d9"] ["answer-field-036cd528-ad80-51a8-8b57-1c098a2a1799" :answer-field/choices "answer-d28d263f-fd3b-5140-9893-862b22fa936d"] ["answer-field-036cd528-ad80-51a8-8b57-1c098a2a1799" :answer-field/choices "answer-bd9c2754-dc15-56f5-8e26-d514db78cd49"] ["answer-field-036cd528-ad80-51a8-8b57-1c098a2a1799" :answer-field/choices "answer-eb547a3b-90e6-5909-88af-1af5468ae682"] ["answer-field-036cd528-ad80-51a8-8b57-1c098a2a1799" :answer-field/choices "answer-a534e8f3-d655-5502-bc89-53c81026a425"] ["question-f9fda870-d2c0-5b67-a720-dd733f4059b5" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-036cd528-ad80-51a8-8b57-1c098a2a1799"] [17592186119807 :knowledge-point/questions "question-f9fda870-d2c0-5b67-a720-dd733f4059b5"] [17592186120309 :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],\\,{a}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],\\,{a}_{3}=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}],\\,b=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}?$"] [17592186120309 :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}+{x}_{3}{a}_{3}=b$, then we have  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{3}[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ {x}_{1}\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{3} \\\\ 0 \\\\ 5{x}_{3}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+5{x}_{3}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3}=2 \\\\ {x}_{2}=3 \\\\ {x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+5{x}_{3}=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 5 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 5 & -1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}-{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 3 & -3\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}-2{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & -9\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :=\\frac{1}{3}{R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -3\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now \n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3}=2 \\\\ {x}_{2}=3 \\\\ {x}_{3}=-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get ${x}_{3}=-3$ and from the second equation we get ${x}_{2}=3.$ Substituting these into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}-3+2(-3)=2\\,⟹\\,{x}_{1}=11.\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=11$, ${x}_{2}=3$, and ${x}_{3}=-3,$ which means \n\n$$\n11{a}_{1}+3{a}_{2}-3{a}_{3}=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}=11+3-3=11.\n$$"] [17592186120309 :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [17592186117993 :answer-field/correct 17592186117998]] "retractions" [[17592186120309 :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n$a_{1} = \\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}, a_{2} = \\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}, a_{3} = \\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}, b = \\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}$.\n\nIf $x_{1}a_{1} + x_{2}a_{2} + x_{3}a_{3} = b$, then what is $x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}$?"]]}]